### Поиск изделий заданного класса с представлением значений параметров
GET http://localhost:80/api/categories/{id}/beers

### Expected response (200):
# [
#   {
#     "id": 123,
#     "name": "Lager Primo",
#     "category_id": {id},
#     "abv": 5.0,
#     "ibu": 25,
#     "amount": 500,
#     "units": "ml",
#     "params": [
#       {"param_name": "amount", "type": "numeric", "value": 500, "min": 100, "max": 200},
#       {"param_name": "abv", "type": "numeric", "value": 5.0}
#     ]
#   }
# ]


### Отбор изделий по значениям параметров
GET http://localhost:80/api/beers?param=amount:gte:400&param=amount:lte:600

### Expected response (200):
# [ { "id": 123, "name": "Lager Primo", "amount": 500, "abv": 5.0, "params": [ {"param_name": "amount", "type": "numeric", "value": 500}, {"param_name": "abv", "type": "numeric", "value": 5.0} ] } ]
